         "description": "<p><span>A </span><span>norte-americana</span><span> falou pela primeira vez um mês depois de sobreviver a duas doses de injeção letal e revelou as sequelas físicas e psicológicas que continua a enfrentar. </span><span>Aos</span><span> </span><span>50</span><span> </span><span>anos,</span><span> </span><span>Christa Pike</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>que</span><span> </span><span>está</span><span> </span><span>no</span><span> </span><span>corredor</span><span> </span><span>da</span><span> </span><span>morte</span><span> </span><span>há</span><span> </span><span>mais</span><span> </span><span>de</span><span> </span><span>três</span><span> </span><span>décadas,</span><span> </span><span>não</span><span> </span><span>sabe</span><span> </span><span>o</span><span> </span><span>que</span><span> </span><span>lhe</span><span> </span><span>reserva</span><span> </span><span>o</span><span> </span><span>futuro</span><span> </span><span>e</span><span> </span><span>poderá</span><span> </span><span>voltar</span><span> </span><span>a</span><span> </span><span>enfrentar</span><span> </span><span>uma</span><span> </span><span>tentativa</span><span> </span><span>de</span><span> </span><span>execução.</span></p>",
